{"unit_id":"functy23__dsh-fullscreen-settings#card-zh","repo":"functy23/dsh-fullscreen-settings","commit":"dd57665a894fa2f56a196a2c83e4efbdc77ed10c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH Fullscreen Settings**（DSH 网页客户端插件）：将设置弹窗改为铺满窗口的整页设置界面。它通过注入 CSS 调整设置面板布局，并注册 `settings.header` 插槽，将官方标题替换为左上角返回按钮。主要变化包括隐藏遮罩、扩宽分类栏、限制内容列宽度，以及提供返回上一页操作。适合希望在网页端以整页方式浏览 DSH 设置的用户。无需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:54-68","lib/client.js:135-154"]}
{"unit_id":"functy23__dsh-fullscreen-settings#card-en","repo":"functy23/dsh-fullscreen-settings","commit":"dd57665a894fa2f56a196a2c83e4efbdc77ed10c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**DSH Fullscreen Settings** reshapes the DSH web settings dialog into a full-window page. It injects layout CSS and adds a top-left back button through `settings.header`. The page hides the overlay, widens the category rail, and caps content width. No API key or external service is configured.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:54-68","lib/client.js:135-154"]}
