{"unit_id":"functy23__dsh-fullscreen-settings#feature-1","repo":"functy23/dsh-fullscreen-settings","commit":"dd57665a894fa2f56a196a2c83e4efbdc77ed10c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH Fullscreen Settings** 的功能「全屏设置布局」：将设置面板铺满窗口并隐藏遮罩，同时调整侧栏宽度和内容最大宽度。。通过客户端插件初始化自动生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:54-56"]}
