{"unit_id":"functy23__dsh-fullscreen-settings#feature-3","repo":"functy23/dsh-fullscreen-settings","commit":"dd57665a894fa2f56a196a2c83e4efbdc77ed10c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH Fullscreen Settings** 的功能「关闭行为回退」：优先调用客户端 `closeTopModal()`；不可用时尝试点击设置面板的官方关闭按钮。。通过客户端插件初始化自动生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:94-105"]}
